ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO1", "As we enter the trial we will find a small add group right at the beginning which are easy to deal with. Once completed we will go around the cliff to the left and wait at the top of the ladder ready to deal with the first boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO2", "The tank needs to tank the Mantikora so it faces away from the group. Position it in the middle of the room, facing it towards where it spawned. The rest of the group stacks behind the Mantikora. One healer & two damage dealers need to stand slightly further away from the rest of the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO3", "Popcorn Circles - Three red circles will be put on random players. The boss raises his staff & players will then get the popcorn with a green and then red circle slowly appearing underneath the player. The circle will stun you and then you will be thrown in the air. You have to dodge roll out of the first circle.")
