ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO5", "Black Holes - A black hole will appear under any player in the group & will port you to a sideboss. You & 3 more players have 100 seconds to kill it or the Mantikora will enrage and your group will wipe. If the tank is sucked into the hole then the off tank needs to take the main boss. The sideboss cleave attack is a oneshot for non-tanks.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO6", "Poison Shard Circles - The boss drops red circles with a green shard in it that deals poison damage. They will drop at the players standing the furthest from the boss which is why we need 3 people stood at the back. Block when the circle lands or it will stun & slow you and you will most likely die. Move out of it as soon as the shard lands.")
