ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO19", "The next large room has 2 doors and 2 levers on the right and left side. The tank goes right where he tanks all Adds until everyone else has killed the mobs on the left. Once we have killed the mobs on both sides we can switch the levers at the top on each room and proceed with the next trash group containing some more Trolls.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO20", "With the next mobs make sure we don't go too fast & deal with each mob group one by one. At the next small room there is another group of mobs with Overchargers & Trolls. When this group is dead, we can go for the right door then the left door. We repeat this twice more in the following rooms. Its then 1 more mob group before the next boss.")
