ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO22", "The tank has to tank Ozara & the Overcharger at the door on the right of the room. The off tank has to tank the War Priest, the Troll and the Archer at the entrance to the room, with enough space to the rest of the group with the Archer arrow spray facing him. The Trolls should not bother us and will not respawn if we don't kill them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO23", "Group formation is key. Healers stand on each side of the boss and the rest of the group has to position themselves in two half-circles around the boss. Melee DDs in the first row, Ranged DDs in the second row. We have to stick to these positions during the whole fight. Make sure there is enough space between all players.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO24", "Pin Bolts - As soon as the fight starts, after 5 to 10 seconds, Ozara will start to pin two random players around her to the ground with a lightning AoE and a bolt sticking out of them. The player on the right or on the left side of you is in charge of unpinning you, every time you get pinned. Use your Synergy button to unpin people fast.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO25", "After we finished Ozara, the door to the next room will open and Trolls will enter the room. The tank has to pull the Trolls asap and move them away from the group. In the next room you will have to deal with the last big trash group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO26", "Before heading up the stairs to the last boss its time to do the Feeding Pit Achievement, we go through the door to the right and stack everyone on the Feed Pile. The member that picked the meat up needs to place it down now and the fight will start. A lot of Trolls will appear that we need to nuke down to get the achievement.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO27", "The tank tanks the Serpent on the platform he appears on facing him north, away from the group. The off tank has to pull all Adds (Mantikoras and Lamias) to the left of the boss & keep them away from the group. Everyone else stacks together on the platform behind the Serpent.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO28", "Poison Phase - When the boss goes down under the ground and appears in the middle of the platform centre the poison phase is incoming. The group has to stack closely so the healers can heal through this phase. When this phase is over, the Serpent does a cleave attack, so stay back until the tank has him facing away from the group again.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO29", "Lamias - After the first poison phase a Lamia will spawn. The off tank must taunt it and pull it to the side of the room away from the group. If the Lamia dies it will explode in a large AoE and do a lot of damage. The healers need to watch the health of the off tank as well as everyone else.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO30", "Totems - After the first poison phase a totems will spawn. The green totem can pull you across the room & you will need to dodge roll twice to get back to the group. The blue can give you a magicka bomb. The poison totem connects to the boss increasing his poison phase damage. Kill them in order of Poison totem first then Blue then Green.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO31", "Magicka Bombs - When one player has the Magicka Bomb, his character will shimmer blue. You then have 15 seconds to lose as much magicka as possible or you will die and damage the group as the bomb scales to your magicker. If you manage to lose enough magicka, the blue light will go away and you will regain some extra magicka.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO32", "Matikoras - When the Mantikora spawns it is the job of either the tank or off tank to taunt him. If the tank taunts him then the Mantikora will die in the AoE damage around the boss. If the off tank taunts him then you must make sure the DDs focus the Mantikora down very quickly without losing the group formation.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO33", "Pink Orbs - When the second Mantikora spawns you will also get pink orbs appearing around the platform. Each player must grab a pink orb or they will die from the shadow explosion from the Serpent. The orb behind the boss should only be taken by the tank. The shadow explosion will also remove any adds and totems that remain.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO34", "Last Poison Phase - When the HP from the boss is very low, at about 1-4% he will start doing a last poison phase with high damage. Healers have their ultimate ready and have enough Magicka to heal through this last phase. DDs focus on killing the boss. Keep healing and doing DPS when he is at 0% as this phase will go on a little longer!")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO35", "Hard Mode - Poison Fields - The boss puts his arms up & a green light appears. He puts a big green circle on a random player. If you stand in it, you are dead. If you stack correctly the poison field should spawn in the stack. This means that everyone can dodge roll away from the centre & spread out to avoid it & each others poison fields.")

ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO36", "Low CP Damage Mitigation - vSO - Blue(Passives - Quick Recovery 10, Hardy 10, Elemental Aegis 10, Preparation 10)(Slot - Enduring Resolve 10, Unassailable 10)")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO37", "Medium CP Damage Mitigation - vSO - Red(Slot - Ironclad 50) - Blue(Passives - Quick Recovery 20, Hardy 10, Elemental Aegis 10, Preparation 10)(Slot - Enduring Resolve 20, Unassailable 20)")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VSO38", "High CP Damage Mitigation - vSO - Red(Slot - Ironclad 50) - Blue(Passives - Quick Recovery 20, Hardy 20, Elemental Aegis 20, Preparation 20)(Slot - Enduring Resolve 50, Unassailable 50, Resilience 50, Duelist Rebuff 50)")


