ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VAA24", "Meteors - These rain down high damage that has to be blocked or you will probably die. If you survive without blocking you will get stunned and will need to break free.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VAA25", "Storm Atronachs - These drop on random players so the tank must take them into the middle so they die in the groups AoE damage. When they get low health they start to explode with high damage so they must be focused & killed quickly at this point.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VAA26", "Execute Phase - In the execute phase the boss has a self heal that does about 2% of her HP for each stomp she does. This makes the DPS race harder for the group.")

