ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC1", "Wait in the middle of the bridge until the group is ready then run past the first mobs and stop at the wall at the top of the stairs. Mobs come up both sets of stairs. Pull them all together and burn them down as a group. Watch out for the archers.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC2", "The next group of adds appears, it is important to interrupt the Flame Mages ASAP when they raise their staff in the air. Just bash them when they do this. We can also stack the mages to kill them faster! The tank can taunt the mages and run to the right side so they all follow him and stack together at a certain point.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC3", "The 1st boss is next. The tank can pull the boss to the brazier on the left and face him away from the group. The off tank pulls the flame mages to the right side, but still within range of the boss so that AoE damage skills can hit both the adds and the boss. Kill them first and then focus on the boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC4", "There are summoned whirlwinds on the ground that deal a LOT of damage. They follow a random group member with a red circle. Keep walking in a small square to avoid them. Swords are thrown out by the boss, block to avoid damage. At 35% HP the boss has an spinning attack that can kill if you stands too close to the boss. Stay outside the AoE.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC5", "Now it is time to split up into two groups, 1 healer, 1 tank & 4 dd's per group. All members of each group must enter at the same time to avoid people being locked out.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC6", "Left Group – Mobs and gargoyles are first, avoid all the AoE attacks. When this is complete enter the main area. More mobs appear, pull together and burn them, interrupt the flame shapers. The boss will then appear with some Welwa. Always attack the boss, only attack the Welwa when they enrage and grow big.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC7", "Right Group – Various mobs appear, as do levers that need pulling. Gargoyles are next with AoE to avoid. Destroy the catapults then enter the boss area. The boss will disappear and split into four adds, Only one of them is the actual boss. Interrupt the adds flame shaper attack. Block the meteor attack. Move out of the bosses fire attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC8", "Now reunited its another large mob pack to kill. The tank can take the 2 gargoyles away from the group whilst everyone else kills the other mobs first. Interrupt the flame shapers as before. Lots of AoE damage skills help here. When the mobs are dead kill the Gargoyles.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC9", "Enter the last boss room, do not stand in the water or the boss will trigger, go around the room from left to right collecting the heavy sacks and chest prior to starting the fight. Form up on the right side of the room facing the boss just outside the large blue buff on the floor.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC10", "The tank can keep the boss on the pedestal in the middle facing away from the group. All other players stand on the right in the blue circle, close together to gain the DPS buff. At about 70% HP the blue circle will disappear and your group will lose the DPS buff from it.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC11", "Shield Attack - The Warrior has a frontal attack, in which he throws his shield away and it comes back. You will see this attack as a long small strip AoE on the ground. It is important that you either dodge roll out of this attack or that you shield and block.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC12", "Jump Attack - The jump attack is a big round circle AoE with an inner and an outer circle. If you are in the inner circle when he jumps, you are dead, so try as fast as possible to dodge roll out of the red circle if this one appears.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC13", "Adds - During the fight, Destroyers and Flame Mages will appear. Make sure the off tank pulls them on the side and they can be quickly dealt with by a few DD's.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC14", "At 35% the Warrior will explode (this will take out all the remaining adds). He will raise his sword, which will glow bright. Make sure all players spread out immediately and block the knockback attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC15", "Shesahi Storm - There is a special attack of the end boss. He will raise his mighty sword up in the air & starts doing AoE damage that lasts for 4-5 seconds. Everyone needs a shield skill for this phase. Just spam the shields until it's over. This works if group members stand with enough room to each other & are spread out in the whole room.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC16", "Cleave - Right after the Starfall the Warrior has a roundabout attack, but this time the range is much wider and you have less time to react. This is a all-round attack, so make sure to never stand in front or behind the Warrior after the Starfalls.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHRC17", "Frontal Cone Attack - This attack is similar to the Shieldthrow, instead of throwing his shield, he rams his two hander into the ground and a huge shiny frontal AoE attack happens. If you do stand in there you will take a lot of damage. Make sure to dodge out of the red AoE if he targets you.")

