ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL1", "We enter, go through the long room and up the stairs and enter the first part of the Temple of Seven Riddles. Trash packs spawns here with Cursed Monks. They are very easy to deal with. After this a Sun-Eater, Archer and Shadowguard will spawn. These mobs are common throughout this trial and each has specific attacks.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL2", "Sun Eater - Always focus the Sun-Eater first! This lady has a huge eclipse field skill, which deals a lot of damage, slows you and negates your skills. When your group is fighting against the Sun-Eater, the main tank has to taunt the Archer and the Shadowguard, facing them away from the rest of the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL3", "The Archer - has one skill called 'Marked for Death'. This skill will hit one random player and they will be chased by summoned panthers. The longer the Mark for Death is on this player, the more panthers will spawn. Do not try to focus the panthers, just make sure the Archer is killed after the Sun-Eater.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL4", "The Shadowguard - will do an AoE spin attack, which has to be blocked by the main tank. He will do this attack every time he has done his heavy attack. He has another skill called 'Void Rush' which charges a random player and stuns them if they are not blocking. Kill this mob last as it is the least lethal.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL5", "We walk through the door and enter the next room. Focus the Sun-Eater, while the tanks are taking care of the other adds. On the upper level, before the first boss room, there is another trash pack waiting for us. There is also a Savage add, which has to be taunted by the off tank, away from the rest of the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL6", "Savage - He produces an AoE attack that debuffs the physical resistance to zero for all players around him, so make sure to stay away from him. If he is not pulled away from the group then this debuff can affect the whole group, which combined with the other adds can be a wipe.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL7", "Tank the boss where he starts with the boss facing the exit door. Everyone needs access to one of the 6 panels around the room for cleansing. Stay in the healing rings from the healers, but with enough space to the next player to avoid splash damage and cursing. Every player has to stay on his position, unless he is cursed.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL8", "Sar'm'athra Panthers - They cannot be taunted, but they can be chained, rooted and stunned so when they spawn, the off tank or DKs with Chain must pull them close to the boss. When they are in position by the boss keep them there with skills like Eruption or Choking Talons. They need to die fast in the group AoE damage on the boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL9", "Void Pillars - Big blue pillars will spawn in the room on the person furthest from the boss. When the boss glows blue you need to stand with a pillar between you and the boss to prevent the explosion from killing you. The number of pillars decrease each round from 5 in the first round down to 0 when the group will die due to the explosion.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL10", "Curse - After every Void Pillar phase the boss curses 3 players with a red AoE circle below them. Any other player standing very near the AoE will also get cursed. You have 30 seconds to cleanse at one of the active round panels in the room. The panels respawn every 25 seconds. The longer you have the curse the slower your movement becomes.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL11", "Boss Shield Phase - The boss will get a shield at 70% boss HP & again at 30% HP. Red AoE pulses appear under players dealing huge damage. The longer it is active the more damage you will take. This is a good time to use your ultimate's and burn through the shield as fast as possible. Healers need maximum heals at this point, Nova is useful.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL12", "Before the next boss there are  tons of trash packs for your group. The main tank will taunt Renderers, Shadowguards and Archers. The off tank spots Shamans, Brutes and Savages. DDs always focus Sun-Eaters and Shamans first.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL13", "Renderers - They will cast 'Flesh Render' which does a lot of damage and knocks players around them down. The main tank needs to interrupt this skill by bashing the Renderers just before they begin to cast the skill. Everyone else needs to stay away from them and damage from range.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL14", "Shamans - This mob will heal himself, the Renderers and the Brute adds 15-20 seconds after they spawn. He will also deal damage to all players around the healed enemy, so make sure you block or cast your shield when you get damage from this skill, especially if the Brutes are still alive at this point.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL15", "1st Encounter - This encounter has five Add waves. If the group wipes you will have to restart. One healer needs to focus on healing the tanks whilst the other healer focuses on the rest of the group. The tanks need to coordinate to know who is taking which Add and where to avoid everything meeting in the middle and producing too much damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL16", "Wave One - Go down the hill, turn left and go into the cave. The main tank has to taunt the Brutes and the Shaman that spawn. These are priority for the group. The off tank has to take the Renderer and the Brutes outside the cave. The group will focus them as soon as the adds in the cave are dead.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL17", "Wave Two - A Sun Eater will spawn at the position where the Renderer was. This is now the priority. Main tank taunts Archer and Shadowguard, we will deal with these two right after the Sun Eater. The off tank takes the Savage & keeps him off to the side, until DDs are done with the other Adds.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL18", "Wave Three - At the west side a Shaman spawns, at the east side a Renderer spawns. The main tank needs to pull the Renderer away from the rest of the group, whilst the off tank taunts the Shaman so DDs can focus him down.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL19", "Wave Four - A Sun Eater spawns again. The main tank takes the Renderer and the Archer and keeps the Archer facing away from the group. The off tank taunts the Shaman and the Savage. Once the Shaman is dead, the off tank can bring the Savage to the Main Tank and DDs can focus all of them down.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL20", "Wave Five - This final wave has two Sun Eaters in it. The off tank takes the Sun Eater that spawns far West and brings her to the other Sun-Eater. The aim is to bring the two Sun Eaters together, so that DDs can focus them down together. The main tank takes the Shadowguard and the Archer away from the group until the Sun-Eaters are dead.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL21", "Second Bosses - Vashai and Skinrai - For the start of this boss we split into 2 groups. Each group needs a tank, healer and 1 magicka DK DD with the Chain skills. Healers need the Purge skill. One group concentrates on Vashai, the other group on Skinrai. Each group will start at their side of the split in the room.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL22", "Holy and Shadow Aspects - 6 players will get the holy & 6 will get the shadow aspect. You will see either a light or dark glow on your head. If players of opposite aspects stand too near each other they will explode and all players in that AoE will die. Always stay with your group and only change group if your colour changes.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL23", "The aspects are assigned depending on your proximity to each boss at the start and at the end of every Prayer Phase. When you have the holy aspect, you only can deal damage on shadow adds or the shadow boss & vice versa.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL24", "Tanking - The tanks pull their boss into their group so that each group member gets the same colour aspect. They then use the Inner Fire skill to switch their boss with the other tanks boss, so that the boss with the opposite aspect colour is in your group and can be damaged. Besides the two bosses, no one else moves!")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL25", "After every Prayer/Reform Phase there will be an aspect colour change. 3 players (excluding tanks) will get the opposite colour. These players have to very carefully cross the room, moving CLOCKWISE, and join the other group. If you miss the colour change you will get a different colour to your group and you will bomb them and kill the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL26", "10 seconds after every Prayer/Reform Phase Adds will spawn. The tank and the DKs have to pull the right colour adds to the matching boss so they die in the AoE damage. If the adds are still alive after the following Prayer/Reform Phase, they will begin to deal very high damage, so make sure all adds are killed before this phase.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL27", "Skinrai and his adds cast a Lunar Flare on up to 4 players in their field of view. This Flare must be purged by the healers. They also cast Lunar Destruction which has to be interrupted by bashing them. Make sure to interrupt them quickly because this skill deals a lot of damage and you will die when no one interrupts.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL28", "Vashai casts a negate field on the furthest player in his field of view. The tank taunts him facing away from his group, so only the tank gets the field. The adds from Vashai use an orb ability that sends 3 orbs into the room. They deal more damage the further they travel. The tank taunts them facing away from the other group in the room.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL29", "Both bosses will teleport from their current position to the opposite side of the room. Which side each boss lands is random. The floor then divines itself into 2 colours, light and dark. You must stand on the SAME colour to the aspect colour you current have on your head. Move CLOCKWISE to avoid bombing other players with a different colour.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL30", "After an explosion no one has an aspect. They will then be given according to which boss you stand next to. So when the explosion is over you have to quickly run back to your starter Boss so you will get the correct aspect again. This time you can run across the room, because you can’t bomb any other players, because no one has an aspect yet.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL31", "When 1 boss dies all players lose their aspects and a timer counts down to the final explosion. The remaining Boss teleports to the centre of the room and after 20 seconds he explodes all players are killed. Both bosses must take very similar damage to avoid one Boss dying before the other boss. We must be aware of the health of each boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL32", "2nd Encounter - This encounter has 6 Add waves split into 2 sections. The Sar'mathra Panthers cannot be taunted. They will put 'Mark for Death' on 2 random people. If the panther catches the marked player they will one shot them. 30 seconds later the mark will switch to another player. Run in a circle to avoid being caught by them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL33", "Right Side Chainpull - Wave 1 - 1 Sun-Eater, 1 Archer, 1 Shadowguard and 1 Savage appear. Kill Sun Eaters first.  The main tank faces the Archer away from the group. The main tank also has to deal with the Shadowguard and keep him away from the Sun Eaters. The off tank takes the Savage and tanks him near the Shadowguards, away from the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL34", "Right Side Chainpull - Wave 2 - You have to deal with one Sun Eater, 2 Archers and 2 Shadowguards. Focus the Sun Eater first. The main tank has to taunt the Archers by the entrance gate to group them both, keep them facing away from the rest of the group. The off tank has to take the Shadowguards away from the Sun Eater.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL35", "Right Side Chainpull - Wave 3 - Do some initial damage to the Archer. The main tank has 2 more Archers to taunt in a second so for now taunt the Shadowguard away from the Sun Eater. Focus DPS on the Sun-Eater. The main tank takes all 3 Archers to the entrance gate. The off tank deals with the Shadowguard and Savage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL36", "Left Side Chainpull - Wave 1 - One person needs to climb the ramp and pull the chain. We will then get 1 Sun Eater, 2 Archers and a Savage. Focus the Sun-Eater first. The 2 Archers can be taunted by the main tank in the group with them facing away from the group. The off tank has to taunt the Savage and take him out of the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL37", "Left Side Chainpull - Wave 2 - This time its 2 Sun Eaters, 2 Shadowguards and a Savage. Kill the Sun Eaters first. The main tank has to taunt the Shadowguards and take them out of the group. When the Sun Eaters are dead, he can bring them back into the group. The off tank taunts the Savage and takes him out of the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL38", "Left Side Chainpull - Wave 3 -  1 Archer, 2 Shadowguards, 2 Sun-Eaters and 1 Savage. The Archer & 2 Shadowguards spawn first. Before the Sun Eaters spawn, the main tank has to pull the Shadowguards out of the group. Then focus your DPS on the Sun Eaters. The off tank takes the Savage away from the group until the others adds are dead.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL39", "3rd Encounter - We have 3 waves of mobs to kill. Cursed Monks drop in from above and do an AoE. Move away from them to avoid the AoE. Some players will get 'Mark of Death' on them from the Archers. All panthers in the room will then target the player. Run around the edge of the room to pull all panthers away from the rest of the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL40", "3rd Encounter - Wave 1 - 1 Sun-Eater, 1 Archer, 1 Shadowguard and 1 Savage will spawn. The Sun Eater spawns on the right mid-way down, kill this first. The Archer appears on the left side of the room and the tank taunts him facing away from the group. The off tank takes the Shadowguard & Savage away from the group to be killed last.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL41", "3rd Encounter - Wave 2 - 2 Sun-Eaters and 2 Savages spawn. The first Sun Eater spawns on the left side near the wall, target this first. After the first Sun Eater is dead, the second one will spawn on the right of the room. The tanks take a Savage each, splitting them up to opposite sides of the room.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL42", "3rd Encounter - Wave 3 - 2 Sun-Eaters, 2 Archers, 1 Shadowguard and 1 Savage spawn. The Sun Eaters spawn at the same time on opposite sides. Kill the right then the left. The tank needs to take both Archers, that appear at opposite ends of the room, to the exit. The off tank takes the Shadowguard and Savage away from the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL43", "Final Boss - Rakkhat - This boss fight has many mechanics in 2 main areas, 1 inside & 1 outside. Inside the main room are eight pads around the central platform. Positioning and timing are both important here. We need 2 'runners' for the outside area whilst the rest of the group will remain inside.")
