ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL52", "Player Deaths - When a player dies a cat is spawned. The more deaths the more cats which can become problematic as your overall DPS on the boss will be reduced and the fight can quickly spiral out of control.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL53", "Void Spheres - This is an attack from the middle that shoots around 15 small sphere projectiles out. They have quite high damage so be aware of them and use shields and heals.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL54", "Lunar Phase - At pad 8 all pads will turn gold. Everyone needs to stand on a pad, the middle pad will buff 4 players. On each pad an add will spawn. The 4 players in the middle can 'beam attack' the adds. DDs on pads 1, 2, 3 & 8 & DDs on pads 4, 5, 6 and 7 work as teams to kill the same adds. After this phase you start back at pad 1 again.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL55", "Execute Phase - When the boss gets 11% health he will move to the middle. Starting on pad 1 a Light Orb will appear connected to Rakkhat. This causes him to take a lot less damage. A DD must run through the panel & collect the Orb. After 5-10 seconds another Orb will appear in the middle of pad 2 and so on. Focus all damage on the boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL56", "Hard Mode - Runners - When the runners come back from doing the outside run they can't cleanse & will have a debuff on them that can be spread to other players. This means that for the next run we need to send 2 different runners as the original runners can no longer go outside.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_VMOL57", "Hard Mode - Assassins - When 2 shadows are killed in the outside area an Assassin will spawn inside with the group. The off tank needs to pull them into the group AoE damage. They have a Tornado attack that will knock back players in range of the attack.")

