ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS1", "Saint Llothis the Pious - For the Saint Llothis the Pious boss make sure to kill the adds as quickly as possible by pulling them near the boss or they will enrage and can oneshot everyone. The main boss has two dangerous attacks, Defiling Blast and Oppressive Bolts.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS2", "Noxious Gas - This is a magic damage DoT, Llothis teleports to 1 of 3 positions around the arena leaving behind a poison cloud which slows, damages and healing de-buffs players inside it. Make sure to avoid this area.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS3", "Defiling Blast - This target 1 player who will get a green glow on him. The boss fires a cone of damage towards the player. Non-targeted players in the cone take much more damage than the targeted player. The cone applies a DoT that can be purged. Can apply poisoned status effect. Targeted player STANDS STILL and other players move out of it.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS4", "Oppressive Bolts - The boss will charge up for one second and glow green. He then raises his weapon straight up and shoots poison balls to all group members, this mechanic can and must be interrupted by either the tank or someone else.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS5", "Corroding Bolt - The boss will charge up for one second then he releases a Bolt which targets only the player/tank currently with aggro. This can be blocked or roll dodged.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS6", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Enrage - The Attendants Enrage 30-35 seconds after spawning.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS7", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Early Death - The Attendants die/sit down at 12-20% of their HP.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS8", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Energy Arc & Energy Convergence - 4 Laser Beams come from the Adds eye & focus a spot 5-10 meters beyond the position of it's current target. The lasers sweep back to the feet of the Add damaging those who cross them. Once the lasers reach the Adds feet they explode dealing huge damage. Can be blocked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS9", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Hydraulic Sweep - The Attendant kneels down & creates a 90 degree cone of damage in a small area in front of it")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS10", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Pulse - A single laser beam that targets the player/tank currently with aggro.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS11", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Pulverize - The Attendant flies up a short distance in the air then crashes back to the ground damaging all in an AoE around it.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS12", "Imperfect Attendants Adds - Expunge - This is the light attack of the adds.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS13", "Two healers stand outside the group one on the left and one on the right side to catch the teleport attack from the boss. Kill the adds fast or they will enrage.  When Felms reaches 25% health or lower the adds will enrage faster, which means you really need to make sure to kill them fast.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS14", "Shrapnel Storm - The Boss teleports to the furthest player & leaves a red pulsing AoE on the floor. The longer you are exposed to the Shrapnel Storm, the more damage it will do to you. 1 AoE is dropped at first. From 75% the Boss will start dropping 2 Storms & at 50% 3 Storms each time. Interval between Shrapnel Storm is every 25-30 seconds.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS15", "Bleeding - If you are exposed to Shrapnel Storm, you will also get a Bleeding DoT on you which deals damage. You can cleanse this debuff.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS16", "Manifest Wrath - The Boss holds his hand up and shoots two red AoEs on the ground where 3 small sized AoEs will pop out of and go in a certain direction and damage everyone in its way. If you stand in the middle of this AoE you will get hit by all 3 and die. You can block this to reduce the incoming damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS17", "Pneuma Projection Adds - Cyclonic Carving - Whirlwind/Steel Tornado. Does a small amount of damage that increases a lot when the adds are enraged. Can be blocked/roll-dodged It also applies Maim debuff to players.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS18", "Pneuma Projection Adds - Lead to Slaughter - Only 1 Player is targeted by this attack, usually the furthest player away. They are then pulled/chained into melee range. This can be blocked but can be very difficult to see before it happens. If the teleport catcher is pulled they need to get back into position very quickly.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS19", "Saint Olms - Tank the boss facing him to the right side of the map with a healer so they can kite the shock fields that will otherwise land on the tank. Everyone else forms 2 loose semicircles behind the boss with room between each player. Protectors will spawn from time to time, they make the boss damage immune so kill them quickly.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS20", "Thundering Tailslap - The boss slams his tail down on the player if he has aggro and is stood behind the boss near the tail. The slam releases small Lightning AoEs which travel in different directions and stun anyone not blocking them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS21", "Shockball Spit - The boss raises his head up high and fires 1/2 Lightning Orbs onto 1/2 Players which creates a Shock AoE when it lands on the player. The AoE slows and damages anyone inside it. Move/rolldodge out of the AoE. If you know that you’ve been targeted then go to a corner so it does not land in the middle of the arena.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS22", "Storm the Heavens Part 1 - The boss flies up & hovers above the arena and spits a shock beam onto the ground. He fires 3 Lightning AoEs in each wave with 5 waves in total. The interval between each Storm of Heavens is roughly 35-40 seconds.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS23", "Storm the Heavens Part 2 - Static Lightning field AoEs that are fired from and land below each Player's feet. 5 waves are thrown. Constant walking movement keeps the AoEs away from you. Walking away backwards from the epicentre of the Storm the Heavens means you don’t accidentally run into more than 1 fast moving lightning AoE from the storm.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS24", "Gust of Steam - At 90%, 75%, 50% & 25% the boss jumps and slams the ground 4 times. People need to make sure not to overlap with each other. Boss jumps from one side of the room to the other. Quickly going to the entrance of the opposite wall to the entrance can prevent damage from being too high.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS25", "Trial by Fire  - Starting at the 25% execute phase, flame meteors hit the arena creating gigantic red fire wall AoEs which fill most of the arena. 3 Meteors are dropped in total. They drop in any order in 3 positions Left, Middle & Right 2 seconds apart from each other. Try to look for them spreading out and avoid them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS26", "Scalding Roar - Boss breathes steam in a cone in front of himself and kills everything in it. This should normally be dealt with by the tank who can position this mechanic away from the group, but should the tank lose control this can do a lot of damage to the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS27", "+1 - Llothis - He spawns at 85-90% of the main boss HP. After 3 minutes he enrages so he needs killing fast & must be focused when he is up. 1 person needs to focus him & use crushing shock to interrupt his Oppressive Bolts. Make sure the mini boss is down just before each main boss jump phase. Be aware of all the extra attacks and mechanics.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS28", "+1 - Felms - Having a player at the entrance and exit helps to place the teleport jump so that the maim dps debuff won't hit the group. He enrages after 3 and a half minutes so he needs killing fast. Make sure the mini boss is down just before each main boss jump phase. Be aware of all the extra attacks and mechanics.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NAS29", "+2 - 1 healer goes far right & heals the tank, deals with the teleport and places the shock fields near the wall. The other healer goes far left to heal the group & deal with the teleport. Off tank pulls mini bosses to the group AoE damage near the boss. 1 person needs to focus on interrupting Oppressive Bolts.")

