ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR1_D", " - Portal Mechanic - Shadow Realm\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR2_D", " - Portal Mechanic - Malevolent Core orb\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR3_D", " - Portal Mechanic - Normal World Shards\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR4_D", " - Shade of Galenwe – Ice Damage\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR5_D", " - Shade of Siroria – Fire Damage\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR6_D", " - Shade of Relequen – Shock Damage\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR7_D", " - Main Portal Mechanic - Wind of the Welkynars\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR8_D", " - Main Portal Mechanic - Nocturnal's Favor\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR9_D", " - Final Boss - Orbs\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR10_D", " - Final Boss - Laser Beam\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR11_D", " - Final Boss - Teleporting Cone\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR12_D", " - Final Boss - Creeper Tentacles\n")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR13_D", " - Final Boss - Execute Phase")

ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR1", "During the fight, a portal will spawn in the middle of the room. As soon as this happens 4 DD's (or 3DD's & a healer or tank), need to enter to be sent to the Shadow Realm. Adds in there cannot be killed (but can be rooted). Once they reach the portal, they will get into the normal world and your group has to kill them there.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR2", "In the Shadow Realm, there are several crystals that need to be destroyed. They may contain a Malevolent Core orb, which needs collecting and taking to a yellow circle that will appear on the floor. Once you have taken all of the cores to the yellow circles the portal will close and you will end up back in the normal world.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR3", "When a crystal is destroyed in the Shadow World, a golden glowing shard spawns in the normal world. The other players in the normal world have to send these shards into the shadow realm by pressing the synergy button. Without them the portal group cannot remove the orbs & failing to do this for the last boss will cause a group wipe mechanic.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR4", "After the initial mobs you will have the gryphon and mini boss to kill. The main mechanic here is Hoarfrost which is white whirlwind AoE. This needs picking up and holding by a player for 6 seconds until a synergy pops up, drop it and let another player take it. If its not picked up then it will damage the whole group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR5", "After the initial mobs you will have the gryphon and mini boss to kill. The main mechanic here is fire AoE that will hit a random player. If it hits you and you see a yellow AoE under you then STAND STILL and let 3 others stack on you as this will reduce the damage. If you see it on someone else then go and stand with them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR6", "The main mechanic here is Voltaic Overload. You will see a large blue AoE around you. You now have to weapon swap and stay on that other bar for 10 seconds. If you don't do this or swap back to your other bar you will shoot lightning bolts at your everyone. After 10 seconds, you will stop glowing and can swap skill bars again.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR7", "In the Shadown Realm, you will see a AoE circle spreading out from the portal. When it covers the whole room, there will be an explosion that does damage. To avoid this, run to one of the corners & use the synergy that appears as a yellow circle. This makes you fly to a platform above away from the explosion. Jump down after it has exploded.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR8", "Nocturnal's Favor -  The boss charges a huge ball and shoots it at someone. As long as the tank has taunt it is not a problem, the tank will survive but everyone else would die. That is also the reason why an off tank or healer has to go into the main portal, the Shadow of Z'Maja does the same attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR9", "Orbs - During the fight, purple orbs will spawn and slowly fly towards the group. You have to destroy them before they reach the group, as they will otherwise explode and stun players if they hit someone. If you kill the Orbs they will shoot 3 small Orbs at random players, placing a DoT on the players, you can dodge-roll this.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR10", "Laser Beam - Z'Maja sends out laser beams from the top of her head that have to be kited. They will follow you so kite them outside of the group, as everyone inside the beam AoE gets a lot of damage. I recommend having one player standing outside of the group to keep kiting this, so it does not spawn in the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR11", "Teleporting Cone - Starting at 60% boss health, there will be a cone coming from the portal in both the normal world and the Shadow Realm. If you get hit by that cone while you are in the shadow realm, you will get teleported back to the real world and vice versa.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR12", "Creeper Tentacles - Starting at 40%, Creeper Tentacles will spawn somewhere in the room. These tentacles need to be focused down, because they do a ground attack which targets players, stuns them and silences them for several seconds, so you aren’t able to use any abilities.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NCR13", "Once Z’Maja is dead, her Shadow Image will spawn in the middle of the room. During this phase many of the previous mechanics will continue to appear. The main tank needs to face the boss away from the group and the group needs to be aware of various AoE & other mechanics whilst doing as much damage as possible to the Shadow Image.")

