ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF1", "We start with some easy to kill mobs, avoid the charge of the Kagouti. Up the hill are Spheres that need interrupting when they are charging up their attack, if they are not interrupted the group will take a lot of damage. After that we walk down the hill again and encounter some more Kagoutis and Spheres.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF2", "Negatrix & Positrox - Each tank takes one of the bosses to either side of the room. The group will focus 1 boss down to 10% health and then switch to the other boss. When the 2nd boss is dead go back and kill the first. Healers need to use 'Purge' and take care of both tanks and the group. Do not stand directly between the 2 bosses.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF3", "Electric Beam - If the bosses get too near each other they will be connected by a beam that damages anyone it touches. The damage they do also gets higher the longer they are connected. This is why the tanks need to keep them apart at either side of the room.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF4", "Shock Field - The boss will place a shock field under the tank, it deals a large amount of damage, so both the tank and the group need to avoid it. Simply walk out of it.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF5", "Sparkles - The boss will move his tail and sparkles will appear, they are slow moving balls that stun & damage everyone they hit. It also leaves a DoT on you that the healers can purge. If you block then you will not be stunned & will not take as much damage. Give the boss enough room to be able to see this mechanic and have time to block.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF6", "Bleed & Heal Debuff - The boss puts a nasty bleed & heal debuff on the tank, make sure that the healers apply enough heals to heal through or purge it. This is why its important that the tank holding the boss, that is not being attacked by the group, also has a healer to cover them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF7", "Head Bang - The boss will knock the tank to the ground and it is important that a someone else interrupts the Boss. If they do not do this within 3-5 seconds the tank will die. This can be blocked by tank but it is easy to miss the animation of the attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF8", "Dwarven Spheres - These spawn after some time and do a direct damage attack followed by a poison DoT that is purgeable. They also do a Snipe attack which can one shot you, it is avoidable and interruptible. 2 DDs can interrupt the Snipe with Crushing Shock. If 8 Spheres spawn they will enrage & their Snipe will charge faster.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF9", "Firebugs - Firebugs spawn & need pulling into the group so we can AoE them down as fast as possible. It can help to block as they can deal quite high damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF10", "Enrage - When one of the bosses is dead the other boss needs to be killed very quickly. The Spheres will enrage and those using Purge need to increase its use to every 2-3 seconds as the Poison DoTs will deal more group damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF11", "The 2nd boss fight starts after the first boss is dead. We have to kill some mobs and then the second boss will spawn in the middle of the room. Spread out around the boss to avoid unnecessary damage. A Centurion Add spawns which needs to be tanked near the boss. DDs focus on the boss and the Centurion will die from the group AoE.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF12", "Portals - After 30 seconds & every 90 seconds 4 portals appear & 4 DD's use them to go to the platform above. They have 60 seconds to kill 4 Spheres & press the 4 buttons in front of them at exactly the same time. Use the same portal to come back down and re-join the boss fight. It best to deploy a shield before using the portals.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF13", "Staff Attack - The boss does a heavy attack that does staff damage to the tank. It spawns sparkles around the boss that will stun if they are not blocked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF14", "Knockback - The boss swings his staff in a large cone AoE that will knock you back and do a lot of damage. You can block this attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF15", "Staff Beam - This is a lightning staff heavy attack that both deals damage & drains magicka on 4 players. The final tick of this attack stuns the 4 players and deals damage. This attack can be interrupted.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF16", "Shock Meteors - These fall down from the ceiling & do damage that cannot be shielded. They are easy to avoid so move out of them. Getting hit by multiple Meteors will most likely kill you.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF17", "Centurion - First appears 6 seconds into the fight, then one more every 60 seconds. They don't die, just deactivate. Every 30 seconds they produce steam which does damage & gives a healing debuff which can stack up to 10 times, which means you get 0 healing received. The tank has to be careful with this.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF18", "The Centurion also does a heavy attack which is hard hitting. The tank has to make sure to have enough health to be able to block it. If nobody is in close proximity to the Centurion then it will start spinning around and dealing damage, if someone gets close the Centurion will stop doing it.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF19", "Shades - When the boss reaches 75% health he will disappear & be replaced by 4 shades. The tank must remain stood on a small green area. The shades will activate & use a shockwave on the tank who must face the shockwave & block to prevent bleed damage & everyone in range being killed. This happens every 40-45 seconds.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF20", "Sharpened Conduit - When the boss reaches 60% health, conduits will start to spawn that will drain your magicka. They appear in random locations over the arena. These need to killed as a priority and must dies as fast as possible.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF21", "Charged Refabricated Centurion - When the boss reaches 40% health a Refabricated Centurion spawns that does a lightning spin AoE attack every 30 seconds. The off tank can pull him to the side of the arena away from the group. It will eventually die as it discharges itself of energy.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF22", "We now have some spiders & adds to deal with. The tank will go right and taunt all the spiders with him but not the boss, whilst the rest of the group goes left until they reach the 5th octogan section. We all then need to stack in the very middle of the 5th circle to avoid the spinners whilst we kill all the spiders & adds.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF23", "Archcustodian - The tank will now fetch the boss. It can only be killed in its stun phase when he doesn't have his shield. We walk backward until we reach a 'shock line' that we activate as the boss approaches. It stuns the boss for a few seconds and we do damage. We all need to be behind the shock line. We repeat this until the boss is dead.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF24", "Adds & Blades - After each stun phase, 2 adds spawn. If they get too near the boss they will also get a shield, so keep them away so that they can be damaged. When the next stun phase happens pull the adds back into the group AoE damage. The blades deal damage and put a bleed on you so use shields & stay in range of the healers.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF25", "We now have to go through a hallway with spinning blades and some adds. We need to kill a new Capacitor add that does an AoE attack on 1 person. It slowly grows until it explodes. You need to block this or you will get stunned and it will drain your magicka.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF26", "Junkyard - Here we need to kill the big blue Centurion. When he is nearly dead he revives spheres around him. A DD needs to go to each of the spheres and interrupt them. We repeat the same thing with the next Centurion and adds. We are then ready for the next boss fight.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF27", "Reassembly Committee - This fight requires a very high amount of coordination. We split into 2 groups so that we can damage both the Reducer and the Reactor. It is best to tank them in a triangle as this makes sure that they cannot get connected. If they get connected you will see a huge shock beam between them & they deal a lot more damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF28", "Reactor - He will slam his sword into the ground and unleash an AoE towards someone which will stop & turn into 'fingers'. If you stand in the fingers you will get sucked down and take heavy damage so they must be avoided. The Heavy attack from this boss is also very strong so again it needs to be dodged or blocked depending on your health.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF29", "Reducer - The Reducer does a fire AoE attack which shoots 3 fireballs away from him. Healers have purge ready to cleanse the fire DoT as fast as possible. The Heavy attack from this boss is very strong, so the tank has to make sure to either dodge roll or block it depending on their current health.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF30", "Reclaimer - The middle does not move. He spawns a shield around him which does massive damage to anything that touches it. He places a 'Drain Shock' ground based DoT on players which stuns anyone it hits & drain magicka. It can be blocked. He spawns 'Bombers' which are an issue all of their own.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF31", "Bombers - These spawn on the outside & slowly walk towards the Reclaimer. If they reach him they will charge up and run towards a random target and blow them up. You can shield up so you will not die, as long as they are not empowered. DD's should focus the bombers as soon as they spawn so that they die before they can charge attack someone.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF32", "Stun Phases - These occur at 69%, 39% & 19%. At 3% before each of these phases the tanks bring both bosses to the reclaimer in the middle to stun them. When the bosses hits those percentage numbers, they will get overcharged. Once they were stunned, take them apart again and start from scratch and repeat this till the last stun phase at 19%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF33", "Burn Phase - This starts when 1 of the bosses drops below 25%. Aim to get all bosses to 27% first and then start dropping them all to 22% and then bring them together. Static Bombers will start spawning on the outside and explode. They will spawn closer and close to the middle until there is no room to move around.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF34", "Last Stun Phase - This occurs at 19%. All bosses are brought together at 22% so they get stunned at 19%. Once they are stunned only target the Reclaimer so he dies first & stops spawning Bombers. Once he is dead you can then focus the other bosses one at a time being careful to avoid the shock beam.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF35", "With the 4th boss fight over we will have to fight some more adds in the next long hallways. As before, make sure to focus the Capacitor add first. We also need to take care to avoid the electrified water which drains your magicka if you stand in it.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF36", "Assembly General - The final boss has several mechanics to learn & positioning here is key otherwise you will receive a lot of damage. The healers play an important role in this fight. Different mechanics from his 2 arms need to be dealt with by a DD & the off tank.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF37", "Left Fire Arm - A magicka build with a shield needs to stand up on the platform to the right side of the boss. This is so the fire attack from his left arm only hits that person & not the whole group. If they stand on the edge near the corner they can avoid the fire damage whilst still having the left arm attack focus on them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF38", "Right Blade Arm - The off tank stands on the upper left side of the boss so that they can deal with the damage from his right blade arm. If they fail to attract the blade then it will enter the group and either do huge damage or simply cause a group wipe.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF39", "Poison - Various parts of the area produce poison at various times. These include the area behind the boss and any of the grating area of the floor. Depending on the stage of the fight you need to avoid these areas & stay in the central channel. You will encounter a spinning floor blade but the healers can heal the stacked group through this.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF40", "Stomp - The boss will raise his left foot and stomps the ground. Anyone close to the boss needs to block or you will be knocked back and will take damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF41", "Fingers - The right foot spawns fingers out from the floor that can grab you and you will become stuck make sure to avoid them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF42", "Meteors - The boss will spawn Meteors on players which can deal a decent amount of damage. At this point the floor is not poisoned so you can spread out to avoid spreading damage amongst the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF43", "Shock Nodes - On the upper platforms are some shock nodes. They deal quite a lot of damage so make sure to avoid those if you are one of the people going to the upper platforms.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF44", "Recharge Phases & Spheres - At 85%, 65% and 45% the boss moves to the middle to repair his arms. At this point spheres will spawn. Do not attack the boss as damage is reflected back at you. Focus on killing the sphere & adds where the boss was just stood before he moved to the middle. Stay in the middle channel to avoid the poisoned floor.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF45", "Adds - At 90%, 87%, 70%, 67%,  50% & 47% adds will spawn. The tanks need to pull them into the group AoE, be it on the boss or the spheres so that they burn down quickly and you do not get overwhelmed with adds. Capacitors use draining shock so make sure to block & avoid losing your magicka & getting stunned.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NHOF46", "Execute Phase -  At 25% the boss will go to the middle & start spawning meteors on players. These hit hard so make sure that you spread out around the boss & avoid overlapping them with other players and avoid the poison. The healers need to out heal the incoming damage and everyone else must focus the boss down as fast as possible.")

