ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS1", "Mob packs throughout this trial do heavy damage & use AoE & meteor style attacks that needs taking away from the group to avoid splash damage. If you get hit by enough of these you will die so take care with positioning. Stacking the mobs together is the best option so they die from the group AoE damage. The cats are particularly powerful.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS2", "The Shrine of Jode is next. This is another mob pack with more Cats and Archers. Stack the mobs at the point in the room where it bends to the left and burn in the group AoE again. Take care to avoid the Archers cone attack. Go through the next door as a group with the tank leading.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS3", "The attack from the Cat can do a lot of damage to a group if it lands just after the group has gone into this section as the group will be close together having just gone through the door. As will most mobs in this trial they are not difficult to kill but can do a lot of damage if they are not controlled well.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS4", "The outside area contains another group of mobs before we can reach the first boss. Stack and burn the mobs again then continue down the stairs and around the corner to the first boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS5", "Lokkestiiz - The Ice Dragon is the first boss. He has 3 periods when he goes into the air and we focus on other adds. We kill him when he lands between these phases.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS6", "Lokkestiiz - Tanking - The group needs to stack to the right of his head but not too near his wing as he does a wing thrash attack that does a lot of damage. The tank needs to stand to the left & must maintain taunt on the boss when he is on the floor.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS7", "Lokkestiiz - Ice Circle - The boss will shout into the air & an ice circle will drop on the floor. 1 player must run into the circle to receive a frozen debuff. The healers must now heal that person back to full health to clear the debuff. If we take too long to do this then the player will explode & do damage to anyone near to them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS8", "Lokkestiiz - Atronachs - These will appear as both Frost & Storm Atronachs. We must focus the Storm Atronachs & kill them. Once dead they will leave a shock AoE behind. The tanks have to taunt the Frost Atronachs and take them into the shock AoE's to die.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS9", "Lokkestiiz - Laser Beam - The boss does a laser beam attack that sweeps across the entire area so it cannot be avoided. You must block before it hits you or you will die.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS10", "Lokkestiiz - Fly Phase - At 80%, 50% & 20% HP the boss will fly around the area. At 80% & 20% we will get the Atronachs then get a laser beam. At 50% we get the laser beam almost straight away so we must be ready to block the beams during these phases. The boss also does a long AoE Breath Attack whilst in the air that needs to be avoided.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS11", "Lokkestiiz - Meteor - These hit hard and need to be blocked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS12", "With Lokkestiiz dead we now head out of the boss area & make our way through more mobs then down several flights of stairs until we come to the ladder down to the next boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS13", "Yolnahkriin - The Fire Dragon. He has 3 periods when he goes into the air and we focus on other adds. We kill him when he lands between these phases.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS14", "Yolnahkriin - Tanking - The tank stands to the left of the bosses head & the group stacks to the right. This is so that the Fire Breath attack only targets the tank who must have taunt at all times that the boss is on the floor.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS15", "Yolnahkriin - Area Fire - A large AoE fills the area, you will need to get to the very edge of the area to avoid it. It will remove any lava on the floor and debuff the Iron Servant.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS16", "Yolnahkriin - Fire Breath - If the tank has taunt & the positioning is correct then the tank should be the only person that takes damage from this. The healers can help the tank through this attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS17", "Yolnahkriin - Explosions - These land in the group, the more people that stand in the yellow AoE that appears the less damage the group will take. Healers can help heal through these.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS18", "Yolnahkriin - Fly Phase - He takes to the air at 75%, 50% & 25%. Once he flies away we must run to the off tank at the very outer edge of the area as a large fire AoE will kill anyone remaining in the middle. The boss will land 90 degrees clockwise to his previous position.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS19", "Yolnahkriin - Flame Atronachs spawn in the area that need to be killed. When they die they leave a lava AoE that slowly grows in size. This means that killing them in or near the group needs to be avoided.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS20", "Yolnahkriin - Iron Servants - This unique add needs to be taken by the off tank to the edge of the area 1/4 of the way around the area from the right of the boss until the dragon fly phase happens. When the fire AoE hits the area the Iron Servant will be debuffed and can be killed quickly as it will take greater damage for a short period.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS21", "With Yolnahkriin dead we climb the opposite ladder to the one we came in by and continue through some more outdoor mob packs. Remember to block the attacks & avoid the Archer cones.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS22", "The Shrine of Jode is next. This area has some holes in the floor so be careful where you step. Stack at the base of the large round shrine in the middle and pull the mobs in from around the area. Burn them down in the group AoEs. When everything is dead head out of the far door.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS23", "We have a few more mobs to deal with then we head back down to the courtyard where we encountered our first mobs and go through the main entrance door that is now open. We stop at the empty room and wait for the mobs to spawn. The tanks stack them at the door and we burn them down then head through the final door to the last boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS24", "Final Boss - Nahviintass - We fight this boss on a large round platform. Once we start the outer area is engulfed in flames so make sure you are stood away from the edge. This fight has 3 phases. When the boss goes into the air and we focus on other adds. We kill him when he lands between these phases.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS25", "Nahviintaas - Phase 1 - Mobs appear at the start & the boss is in the air. Stack the mobs and burn them down whilst avoiding the fire that the boss is putting on the ground. When the mobs die fire AoE's will appear on the ground. These need to be avoided so find a safe space away from the AoE's.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS26", "Nahviintaas - Phase 2 - Positions - The boss lands & the main tank needs to taunt him. The tanks stand to the left of the boss so that he takes the Fire Breath attack & the group stands to the right. Do not stand too close or you will be hit by his wing attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS27", "Nahviintaas - Phase 2 - Fire Breath - As well as the Fire Breath targeted at the tank, the boss also does a 180 degree Fire Breath that needs to be blocked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS28", "Nahviintaas - Phase 2 - Head Attack - The boss does a 180 degree attach with his head. You can see this is about to happen when he raises his head. Either block or move back out of range.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS29", "Nahviintaas - Phase 2 - Portals - The boss will shout & portals will appear. A couple of dd's can go into the portal & kill the mini boss. The portals appear 3 times during the fight. The portal can be ignored on normal if you wish, although it can be useful to see the mechanics involved prior to a veteran run.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS30", "Nahviintaas - Phase 3 - At 40% we no longer have portals. Instead the boss shouts and a DoT is applied to all players that needs to be out healed. Members will also get a red AoE under them that will explode and cause a fire AoE to be left behind. It is best to try place this AoE at the edge of the circle away from the group.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NSS31", "Nahviintaas - Phase 3 - Flame Atronachs spawn that can be pulled into the group AoE and killed.")

