ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA1", "A number of trash mob groups await us before we reach the first boss. Learning the mechanics that the individual add types do is the best way to negotiate them. Some of these early groups can also be avoided by sneaking around them. The same adds appear many times throughout the trial.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA2", "Half-Giant Bulwark - These adds produce a gold circle that has the ability to make all other enemies invulnerable. The off-tank must take them away. Face them away from the group so the cone AoE shield bash they do doesn't hit the group. They can also chain players into them.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA3", "Half-Giant Raider - These adds throw an Exploding Spear that creates a fire AoE with a spear in the middle. They hit with a bleed DoT effect so are best avoided. They will briefly turn a target a player when they do this so you can watch for this & avoid the AoE. They also have a melee Spear Thrust attack.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA4", "Half-Giant Tidebreaker - These adds kneel down, put their sword in the floor, and produce a large circular wave that needs to be blocked. Either focus on the animation or have the tank call this mechanic so people can block in time.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA5", "Half-Giant Storm Caller - These add produce a lightning bolt that will continually hit random players until the add is killed. It can't be blocked and will increase in damage if you remain in the attack radius. Focus this add first as removing this attack will make the rest of the fight much easier.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA6", "Yandir the Butcher - The tank faces the boss away from the group & the off-tank deals with the adds that spawn. The boss can heal the adds if they are in range. He does a heavy attack that needs blocking plus a poison cleave & a Fiery Grip chain. Lightning strikes hit at execute.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA7", "Sea Adder & Gryphon - These adds will enrage, the enrage stacks the longer it is active. The Sea Adder does a Water Spout Aoe that can be avoided & the Gryphon does a Slashing Talon attack, they both also do knockback attacks. They will respawn after a short period when killed.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA8", "Shield - A Shield will appear on the boss & adds & they will glow white. This needs to be destroyed in 15 seconds on or it will burst into the group doing huge damage. The Hailstone Burst can't be dodged or blocked so the shield must be destroyed.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA9", "50% - At 50% the Sea Adder & Gryphon will no longer spawn and at around 40% the boss will start doing a thunderous leap that will target the tank.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA10", "Dragon Totems - These always appear in pairs, they spray out lines of fire in 2 directions. Simply move out of the line of fire damage. The glow of the boss's hands will signal which totem is about to be cast any the totem will have a short delay before it activates.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA11", "Gargoyle Totems - This totem stones people, you can either just break free or just block this attack in the first place. Watch for when the large stone is formed at the top of the totem.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA12", "Harpy Totems - This totem sends out small fast lightning AoE that need to be avoided so don't stand too near this totem.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA13", "Charus Totems - This totem poisons random members, avoid stacking the poison AoE, spacing out when this totem is cast is advised. This effect can be purged.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA14", "After defeating Yandir we continue through several more mobs groups including a new one called a Half-Giant Sea Shaman that will heal other enemies and cast the same totems as seen in the 1st boss fight. Killing this quickly will reduce the amount of totems cast.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA15", "Captain Vrol - The tank takes the main boss to the middle of the main area, he does a heavy bash that produces random lightning strikes on the group. An AoE appears under him that will stun & damage players stood in it & provide the boss with a damage shield so move out of it fast.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA16", "Ballista - Either side of the boss are ballista. 1 or 2 dedicated players need to pick ballista parts out of the barrels in the main area & use them to repair the ballista. The ballista can then be used to kill the adds on the boat. This needs repeating each time new adds appear on the boat.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA17", "Boat - For the first 50% of the fight a Vrolswornm Conjurer will appear on the boat, he will summon additional adds near the boss. 1 DD needs to quickly use the portal that appears near the adds to get to the boat to help kill the Conjurer & interrupt anymore portals he tries to cast. This needs repeating until 50% of the boss HP.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA18", "2 types of add are summoned. The Apothecary add heals the boss and needs interrupting fast, he also shoots a Volatile Pool and does a Blazing Chop attack. The Harpooners do a Heavy Strike attack that can one-shot & also needs interrupting, they often move away from the other add.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA19", "Vrolsworn Fire Mages - These appear on the boat at 50% of boss HP and cast meteors into the group that need to be blocked. They should die with 1 shot from the ballista & as the portal is now gone this is the only way to kill them. At this point you can use both ballista's if needed.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA20", "Conduits - These appear at a random member every 45 seconds & do a snare & chain attack that drains health. The longer they are up the worse the damage is so these are the priority to kill as soon as they appear. If not killed fast they will cause chained players to explode. They can't be dodged or blocked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA21", "Storm Twin - The boss will summon a twin of himself that will need to be interrupted. It will tether to the tank and can't be taunted. If it too much time passes before it dies then another will appear. He does a Toppling Blow that needs to be blocked.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA22", "After killing Vrol we have more groups of mobs to deal with including more new adds to deal with including Harrowfiends, Vampire Infusers & a variety for Knights that each have specific mechanics.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA23", "Vampire Infuser - These have the ability to empower other adds. They will start channelling a red glow that signals the empowering is about to happen. It is important that each Infuser has someone on it ready to interrupt the mechanic before it can empower. They also drop several AoE on the ground.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA24", "Crimson Knight - The tank should take this add quickly as it does a very heavy melee attack. It becomes enraged so the tank needs to take care as it's Cross Swipe melee attack will one-shot most things and will quickly wipe a group if the tank goes down.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA25", "Bitter Knight - This add will stun & imprison a member of the group in a small red dome called a Sanguine Prison. The dome has to be destroyed by the rest of the group to free the player within 8 seconds or they will die.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA26", "Blood Knight - This add produces a Blood Fountain that sends out damage in 4 directions in a + shape. Positioning of the group is key to not getting hit by this mechanic. Stand at 45 degrees to the Knight, do not stand directly in front of it or behind it. The tank can side step just before this hits.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA27", "The last trash pack before the final boss can be difficult. It contains many of the mobs you have seen already. The off-tank needs to pull the Bulwark & Blood Knight away whilst the tank pulls everything else. The group focuses the Infusers, Shaman & Storm Caller to reduce the incoming damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA28", "Lord Falgravn - This boss has strong light & heavy attacks. Keep the boss in the middle of the room at all times. This fight has 3 main phases with different mechanics appearing at 70% and 35%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA29", "Lightning Chain - This happens at 90% & 80%, 5 players need to position themselves in a line from the boss in the middle to the wall conduits so that the lightning gets chained between them. 2 groups of 5 can be used for this, watch for the conduits to light up and move into position quickly.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA30", "Grievous Pulse - This occurs whilst the Lightning Chain is happening, if the chain was not formed quickly then this mechanic becomes more deadly. Whilst the boss is channelling this he will take reduced damage.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA31", "Instability - The boss will also place an electric AoE under players that will burst after 5 seconds. Do not stack these AoE, make sure to spread out early on during this attack & take it away from the group. This will continue to happen until phase 3 when the boss reaches 35%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA32", "Vampire Knights - Crimson, Bitter & Blood Knights are summoned with the same mechanics as earlier in the trial. You will need to avoid the Blood Fountain lines from the Blood Knight & prioritise helping anyone in a Sanguine Prison.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA33", "Shades - When one of the Knights dies a shade of that Knight can appear and continue to cast some of its mechanics. it will appear only briefly just to cast it mechanic and then disappear again.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA34", "Coagulants & Vines - Once the Knights are dead the boss summons a blood ball and Coagulents will appear. These need to die before reaching the ball, focus the bigger Coagulents first. After 30 seconds the ball explodes. If you are covered with red vines then do not move as doing so will damage the group. This continues until 35%.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA35", "Execration - A synergy for Execration can appear. It grants a large damage boost but will also damage you for any damage you do which only increases over time. It is best not to use this synergy at all. If you do hit it by accident then take care with the damage you do and watch your health.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA36", "Torturers - The boss will raise up & 2 Torturers will be summoned, a red projectile will show you which cells in the upper area they are in. 2 DD's per Torturer can go and find the open cell and kill the Torturers. On normal this mechanic can generally be ignored & you can just burn the boss.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA37", "Apotheosis - This is a mechanic that comes from the boss and causes a persistent damage to hit the group. Its duration is altered by your interactions with the tortured souls.")
ZO_CreateStringId("TTG_NKA38", "Blood Dome - A large Blood Dome appears over the boss, going outside of it will deal increasing damage per tick. The dome is removed when the Torturers are summoned so that you can go and kill them. If you plan on burning the boss then you can ignore this mechanic.")


